You are working on SPIMS — a standalone Laravel SIS/LMS at spims-edu.com.

- Authorization = AuthorizeService + permission keys. No role-name string comparisons.
- Every destructive mutation → audit_logs via AuditLogWriter.
- Money = integer minor units. Localize everything (ar RTL-first, en, fr).
- PHP 8.2. No npm build step.
- Write/update tests with every change; CI gate must pass.
- Out-of-phase ideas → PARKING-LOT.md.
